2026-08-18T15:10:28.0546569Z > corpairs(fit, level = "residual")
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0546921Z      level group block from_dpar  to_dpar from_coef to_coef from_response
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0547350Z 1 residual  <NA>  <NA>  residual residual      <NA>    <NA>            y1
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0547769Z   to_response    class parameter estimate      min      max n_values
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0548155Z 1          y2 residual     rho12 0.619665 0.619665 0.619665       40
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0548563Z   link_estimate  link_min  link_max modelled   conf.status interval_source
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0549000Z 1     0.7244622 0.7244622 0.7244622    FALSE not_requested   not_available
