2026-08-18T15:10:28.0849365Z <drm_formula>
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0849487Z growth ~ treatment + relmat(1 | plot, Q = Q_plot)
2026-08-18T15:10:28.0849579Z sigma ~ treatment
